OL,3,GNEWSAGraffiti removed from King Richard
OL,4,AIII statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Leicester's best known statues
OL,7,Fhas been cleaned after it was sprayed
OL,8,Fwith yellow paint by vandals.
OL,10,FCrude anatomical shapes were sprayed on
OL,11,Fthe statue of King Richard III, which
OL,12,Fstands in Cathedral Gardens, on Friday.
OL,14,FIt was donated to the city by the
OL,15,FRichard III Society in 1980 and
OL,16,Frefurbished as part of a #2.5m project
OL,17,Ffollowing the discovery of the
OL,18,FPlantagenet monarch's remains nearby in
OL,19,F2012.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
