OL,3,GNEWSAGraffiti removed from King Richard
OL,4,AIII statue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King Richard III Visitor Centre,
OL,7,Fwhich is located next to the figure,
OL,8,Fsaid Leicester City Council's street
OL,9,Fcleaning team "did their magic" and
OL,10,Fcleaned the graffiti.
